<title>USA: Yuma, Ariz., $9.5 mln deal yields 4.75 pct in 2003.</title>
<headline>Yuma, Ariz., $9.5 mln deal yields 4.75 pct in 2003.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Principal Financial Securities Inc said Tuesday it tentatively priced $9.5 million Yuma, Ariz., Municipal Property Corp subordinate lien excise tax revenue bonds at a top yield of 4.75 percent in 2003.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:  </p>
<p>YUMA MUNICIPAL PROPERTY CORP</p>
<p>RE: $9,500,000</p>
<p>SUBORDINATE LIEN EXCISE TAX REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1996</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa</p>
<p>S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>DATED: SEPTEMBER 1, 1996</p>
<p>FIRST COUPON: JANUARY 1, 1996</p>
<p>DUE: JULY 1</p>
<p>NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>    7/1	     Amount	  Coupon	Price</p>
<p>    Maturity	(million)	   (pct)	 (% of par)</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    1997	    $1.215	  3.80	  100</p>
<p>    1998	    $1.205	  4.15	  100</p>
<p>    1999	    $1.275	  4.35	  100</p>
<p>    2000	    $1.345	  4.45	  100</p>
<p>    2001	    $1.420	  4.55	  100</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    2002	    $1.485	  4.65	  100</p>
<p>    2003	    $1.555	  4.75	  100</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
